    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH plugin ecosystem added 12 new plugins, reaching 18,316 total, while the official repo gained 67 stars and shipped dsh 0.2.1-alpha.1. Growth was led by dataelement/dsh-desktop (+19) and anywhere-labs/dsh-desktop (+12), but with 17,019 of 18,052 tracked plugins stale within a day, the health score sits at 36.",
